# P83(WSL):由 actions/win/P83-select-in-both-lists.actions 移植(2026-10-20),步驟與通過條件同下方 Windows 原文；座標取自 WSLg 下的 AT-SPI,為 client 座標。
# P83 on Windows: select a row in each list, so the capture shows both styles
# with a selection -- the sidebar's selected row is where the two differ most.
# Written 2026-10-08. Positions are UIA row centres minus the window's
# GetWindowRect origin, WinUIBackend, 100% scale, window 496x439.
# Pass: the label reads "left: Drafts   right: Sent", and the right list keeps
# its sidebar look (pane background, 36 px rows) with Sent selected.
# P83(Windows):在兩個清單各選一列，讓截圖呈現兩種樣式各自的選取狀態——sidebar 與預設樣式差最多的就是選取列。
# 2026-10-08 撰寫。座標為 UIA 列中心減去視窗 GetWindowRect 原點,WinUIBackend,100% 縮放，視窗 496x439。
# 通過：標籤顯示 "left: Drafts   right: Sent",右側清單維持 sidebar 外觀(窗格背景、36 px 列高)且選中 Sent。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P83 lay out,gtk
click,63,179,,left,,,left (default) list: Drafts,gtk
sleep,,,,,,500000,,gtk
click,254,219,,left,,,right (.sidebar) list: Sent,gtk
sleep,,,,,,20000000,hold 20s so the final capture lands while the window is up,gtk
